Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:02.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mimi, I know what to say now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.76,0:00:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every good gift comes from God...\Nand the best one is us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.16,0:00:14.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dear God... thank You for Papi's strong hands...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.10,0:00:19.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,for Mami's yummy food...\Nfor Mateo and our puppy...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:23.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,for all our friends in the garden...\Nand for Mimi's hugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.00,0:00:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Every good gift comes from You. Amen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:31.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,Amen! Amen! Amen!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.85,0:00:34.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Amen! Now let's eat!
